          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[...] If [she] dies [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]a monetary [stipulation] (and) is valid [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] with the ring of betrothal (qiddush) only. And also [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this [groom ...] that he will come in three months, without delay and without opposition [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]by (in) it Dal\u0101l, his sister, the virgin, the daughter of Jacob (whose) soul is at rest [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] complete [qiddushin]. And we performed a qinyan with them, with Mufarrij and Eli, the sons of M[... for all that is written in this contract]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and on the stipulations, a complete, stringent qinyan, with an implement fi[t for this... all that is written in]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this [writ of] qiddush (\"betrothal\"). And they instructed the scribe to write and the witnesses [to testify ... And this document is valid ... whether according to the statutes]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of our masters, the sages, or in the laws of the kingdoms.\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Khalaf b. Moses b. Aaron (whose) s(oul is at) r(est). Joseph b. R. Solomon ha-\u1e25azzan (who) r(ests in) E(den) [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Siman \u1e6cov b. Eli (may his) e(nd be) g(ood). Solomon b. Nathan (whose) s(oul is at) r(est) Asad b. Abraham(?) [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] ha-Kohen b. Moses (whose) s(oul is at) r(est). Shemarya ha-Levi b. [...]</li></ol>\n",
